<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Hi <%= recipientName %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">This happened <%= processName %> — Salesforce API usage for your <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= crmName %></strong> org reached <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= percentageUsed %>%</strong> of its daily limit, crossing your configured threshold of <strong style="color:#0f172a;"><%= thresholdPercentage %>%</strong>. We've paused this so it doesn't push your org further over the limit.</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Daily API requests used</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= used %> / <%= max %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;">Remaining</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;"><%= remaining %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Usage</td>
    <td style="padding:13px 18px;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;text-align:right;"><%= percentageUsed %>%</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:20px 0 0;">New requests against this org may be throttled by Salesforce until the daily limit resets. Please review your automation and integrations consuming API calls, or raise your threshold from settings if this is expected.</p>
